'''Rin Tohsaka''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel]] collaboration gacha event. She was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 363
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Rin Tohsaka
|name2 = Rin Tohsaka CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Rin Tohsaka CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
First off, it is worth getting out of the way that Rin Tohsaka doesn't have much usage against zombies, despite her range and decent ability against them, as zombies are too aggressive for her.

Her stats work better against aliens, where she can be great to prevent an army from pushing too hard into Cat backlines, all while providing good damage.

Outside of her niche, Tohsaka is a fine generalist with good overall stats.

{{Job|Classification = Backliner}}

